# personal reply policies -- ignored by default. The Hinge one is tracked on
# purpose; keep real people's names out of it, this repo is public.
date.md
policies/*
!policies/hinge_policy.md

# Learned app skills. Device- and account-specific: they are written from live
# runs against this phone's apps and carry whatever those screens said, so they
# are local state rather than source. `SkillRegistry.load_skills` recreates the
# directory on a fresh clone, which then learns its own. The Hinge skill is
# tracked on purpose, beside its policy -- same rule about names.
skills/*
!skills/hinge.json
